# "first" was the closest call. Critics often read S4's "the first" as merely the first member of whatever finite stretch of a series one considers, and S6–S8's "first efficient cause" as an absolutely uncaused first. But the text's own words use it throughout as the first member of the order of efficient causes, the thing an infinite regress would lack, so I counted one sense.
